S4 net2 Vcm phi1 trip SW1
C2 diff Vint {C2} m=1
C1 net1 net2 {C1} m=1
x1 Vcm diff Vint ideal_opamp
x3 Vdd cmp Vint Vcm phi1 ideal_comparator
x4 Vfb net3 vss Vref ideal_inverter
x2 net3 net4 phi1 cmp resb VDD VSS sg13g2_dfrbp_1
